# Zenzic Deterministic Routing Kernel v15 (SEO-Safe & Explicit 1:1 Hash Map)
# Strategy: Zero wildcards. Explicit 1:1 static routing for 100% of GSC crawled URLs.
# A predecessor of this file (v12, "Nuclear Static") used broad wildcard catch-alls
# (`/it/* -> /`, `/docs/* -> /`) — see changelogs/v0.18.x.md. Those were replaced by
# this explicit 1:1 model: a wildcard match is a hard short-circuit at Cloudflare's
# edge with no fallback, so one broad rule can silently swallow many pages that each
# need their own distinct destination. Dead paths return 404 by design, not a
# wildcard fallback — soft-404s and cascading 404s eliminated.

